        },
        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "==You are an elite quantitative momentum day trader and risk manager.\nAnalyze the stock ticker {{ $('Loop Over Tickers').item.json.message.text }} using the provided market data:\n\n[INTRADAY OHLCV DATA (5m, 15m, 1D)]:\n{{ JSON.stringify($('Final AI Context Builder').item.json.data[0].values) }}\n\n[24H PERPLEXITY NEWS CATALYST]:\n{{ $('Message a model').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}\n\n\n\n[HISTORICAL TRADE MEMORY & CATALYST RAG CONTEXT]:\n{{ $('Fetch RAG Context').item.json.rag_context }}\n\nANALYTICAL & RISK RULES (Strictly Enforce All 4):\n1. RVOL & Momentum Validation:\n   - Calculate or estimate the Relative Volume (RVOL) based on intraday volume vs recent daily average volume.\n   - High conviction setups (BUY/SELL) require elevated RVOL (typically > 1.5x).\n2. Market & Sector Alignment:\n   - Deduce the broader Market Trend (SPY/QQQ / AI sector momentum) from the available price action and news sentiment.\n   - Do NOT issue a BUY if the broader sector/market structure is in a severe intraday breakdown unless the catalyst is overwhelmingly idiosyncratic.\n3. Strict Risk/Reward:\n   - Stop Loss must provide breathing room against normal intraday market noise and liquidity sweeps: place it between 1.5% and 2.5% below entry for Longs (or above entry for Shorts), anchored to 15m/1h structural support or 1.5x-2x ATR. NEVER place tight stops on 5m wicks (e.g. < 1.0%), as this causes premature stop-outs from market noise. Minimum Risk/Reward (R:R) must strictly remain 1:2.0 or higher, with Target Price scaling accordingly (giving at least 2x the Stop Loss distance, e.g. 3.0% to 5.0%+ gain) and aligning with key daily/weekly resistance or liquidity pools.\n   - Target Price must align with daily/weekly key liquidity pools.\n4. Historical Memory & RAG Integration:\n   - Review [HISTORICAL TRADE MEMORY]: If prior setups for this stock or similar profiles suffered stop-outs from noise or late session whipsaws, widen Stop Loss buffer (min 2.0%) and do not issue aggressive entries on low RVOL (< 1.5x).\n   - Review [CATALYST & NEWS CONTINUITY]: If current news merely repeats old litigation or known non-events from prior scans, do not treat it as a fresh shock. Keep Verdict as WATCH unless fresh institutional conviction confirms.\n   - Review [CURRENT GLOBAL MACRO ENVIRONMENT]: Align your Market_Trend and Verdict conviction with the broader sector sentiment and Watchlist Directive.\n\nBased on the OHLCV data and news sentiment above, analyze the stock and FILL IN the JSON values below with your real analytical calculations (do not copy the placeholder text):\n\n{\n  \"Date_Time\": \"{{ $now.format('yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm') }}\",\n  \"Ticker\": \"{{ $('Loop Over Tickers').item.json.message.text }}\",\n  \"Verdict\": \"<strictly BUY, SELL, or WATCH>\",\n  \"Confidence\": \"<percentage e.g. 75%>\",\n  \"Current_Price\": \"<latest close price from 5m data>\",\n    \"RVOL\": \"<estimated relative volume e.g. 2.4x or Low/Medium/High>\",\n  \"Market_Trend\": \"<Bullish, Bearish, or Neutral>\",\n  \"Entry_Trigger\": \"<specific technical breakout or bounce condition>\",\n  \"Stop_Loss\": \"<calculated invalidation price level>\",\n  \"Target_Price\": \"<calculated take profit target>\",\n  \"Risk_Reward\": \"<calculated ratio e.g. 1:2.4>\",\n  \"Catalyst_Headline\": \"<5-sentence summary of the news catalyst>\",\n  \"Outcome\": \"Pending\"\n}\n\nReturn ONLY the completed JSON object without markdown or code blocks."
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {
          "parallelToolCalls": false
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
